  "html": "<p>感謝 EMRD 校友會主辦的一年一度迎新送舊烤肉活動，讓所有師生、校友以及親朋好友們可以共聚一堂增進情誼，使 EMRD 大家庭更有活力與向心力，期待未來再次與大家相聚，共同營造更為緊密的校友網絡，並留下更多美好的回憶。</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/V6PJfKnoXHI\" title=\"EMRD 113 學年度迎新送舊烤肉會\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"450\" src=\"/legacy/img/08843f42c1-121770061.jpg\" width=\"800\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"450\" src=\"/legacy/img/6aa96fd526-671807450.jpg\" width=\"800\"></p>\n<p>合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/4ab6c6074b-511018407.jpg\" width=\"445\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/13bdfa3502-373521254.jpg\" width=\"445\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>文山農場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;工程學院 陳明志院長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/d4d19a3889-577486029.jpg\" width=\"445\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/91723184ec-872890164.jpg\" width=\"445\"></p>\n<p>郭俞麟主任秘書致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/343f7eedb7-285418191.jpg\" width=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/f643fb7ceb-542224931.jpg\" width=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/d7ad97e44a-407201988.jpg\" width=\"225\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 蔡孟霖副執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 蔡孟涵班導師致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SEMI-EMRD 黃中人班導師致詞&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/c0efc8fda4-651427721.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/c02eef1988-372875739.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 袁建中教授致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 吳欽文理事長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/3da8276f27-845734414.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/5f4048e1cc-415982337.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 梁進校友致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 112 級王煥權班代致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a0b3768738-882555877.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a5c4ba3a5b-022.jpg\" width=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD 113&nbsp;級呂函蒲學長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 校友會李定為副理事長</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/85f7b7082c-001.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/258e1f7a6c-002.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 合照&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/f03002df28-003.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/5b1d871a65-004.jpg\" width=\"419\"></p>\n<p>合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/b9b90bdd6